#X text 240 83 The MPU-6050 is a 6-axis motion tracking device that
combines a 3-axis gyroscope and a 3-axis accelerometer.;
#X text 240 123 To connect to the device \, set the @connect property
to 1\.;
#X obj 230 128 cnv 1 2 15 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -158925 -1 0;
#X text 240 148 Typical use cases:;
#X text 250 173 • Motion-driven performance control — mapping tilt
\, rotation or acceleration to sound parameters (filter \, pan \, pitch
\, effect depth) \, so that the performer can control the patch through
physical gestures.;
#X text 250 243 • Gesture-based installations — turning a physical
object equipped with an MPU-6050 into an interactive controller: tilting
\, shaking or rotating the object triggers events \, changes the sound
or moves it in space.;
